GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Position_ConversationalProvenanceDataModel> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Position_ConversationalProvenanceDataModel> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_ConversationalProvenanceDataModel> ;
    narr:childCount "11"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "d60479f4df57bd74c60ef357e16a3ce7cbb09a43" ;
    narr:narration """This position holds that a knowledge graph should model conversation rather than facts: as [the speaker puts it, no entity nodes get created when a tool is merely mentioned](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_94), because [the graph models conversation, with statements clustering under positions they support](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_96). The motivating observation is that [the real meeting is the source of truth yet nobody writes it down usefully](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_78), so ingestion plus citation lets readers [tell whether an AI response is hallucinated by whether it cited someone who actually said it](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_78). Architecturally, [the entire graph is append-only and lives in the customer's repo, with the operator claiming zero data retention](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_84), and [the transcript is treated as the truth while perspective interrogates it over time](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_80). Scaling that read path required [a digest-and-expand ontology with permissioning so actors only see calls they attended](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_82). The strategic claim is that [the accumulated graph of human decisions becomes the moat, with the read layer proprietary even when data is stored elsewhere](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_110). The structure also [surfaces gaps in what the organization knows as an inherent graph feature](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_88), and [clarification reactions from attendees feed back as reconciliation statements](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_90). Authority and entity resolution are deliberately deferred: [the graph witnesses what was said but does not pre-encode what it means](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_92).""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_110> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_78> ;
